OL,3,GNEWSAOn the frontline of social care as
OL,4,APM promises reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham wants to
OL,7,Foffer access to free social care
OL,8,Fservices to everyone in England and to
OL,9,Fput his plans to voters at the next
OL,10,Fgeneral election.
OL,12,FHe told the BBC that it would be a
OL,13,Fsystem in which "everyone contributes,
OL,14,Feveryone is covered" and did not rule
OL,15,Fout tax rises, acknowledging it may be
OL,16,F"difficult or unpopular" with some.
